# Pairs with OriginAuthenticated. A saga control call attributes the saga to a
# coordinator other than the credential-bound caller.
MODULE: ReceiverCoordinatorMismatchAccepted
TARGET: OriginAuthenticated
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a body coordinator that disagrees with the stamped origin is accepted

--- FIND
         ELSE IF m \notin RequesterQuery /\ body # NoBody /\ body # hdr THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- REPLACE
         ELSE IF FALSE THEN <<"denied", NoHeader>>
--- END